{comment: Intro}
[D]

{comment: Verse 1}
[D]Love me tender, [E7]love me sweet, [A7]never let me [D]go.
[D]You have made my [E7]life complete, and [A7]I love you [D]so.

{comment: Chorus}
[D]Love me [F#7]tender, [Bm]love me [D7]true, [G]all my [Gm]dreams ful[D]fill.
[F#m7b5]For my [B7]darlin' [E7]I love you, and [A7]I always [D]will.

{comment: Verse 2}
[D]Love me tender, [E7]love me long, [A7]take me to your [D]heart.
[D]For it's there that [E7]I belong, and [A7]we'll never [D]part.

{comment: Chorus}
[D]Love me [F#7]tender, [Bm]love me [D7]true, [G]all my [Gm]dreams ful[D]fill.
[F#m7b5]For my [B7]darlin' [E7]I love you, and [A7]I always [D]will.

{comment: Verse 3}
[D]Love me tender, [E7]love me dear, [A7]tell me you are [D]mine.
[D]I'll be yours through [E7]all the years, till the [A7]end of [D]time.

{comment: Chorus / Outro}
[D]Love me [F#7]tender, [Bm]love me [D7]true, [G]all my [Gm]dreams ful[D]fill.
[F#m7b5]For my [B7]darlin' [E7]I love you, and [A7]I always [D]will.
